    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get together with your friend, slap yourselves down onto a couch, and prepare for a<strong> Cattacular</strong>\u00a0time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clay Beats</strong>\u00a0is a rhythm-based co-op game where you and your bestie get together to craft pottery for desperate customers in need! In the village of Potteria you two play as orange and black fuzzballs, cats training to be<strong> pawtastic</strong>\u00a0pottery partners! Play through several unique songs, meet whacky characters, and work together to become<strong>\u00a0pawttery</strong>\u00a0masters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourselves in a casual couch co-op experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter unique and comedic characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through seven engaging levels and custom-made songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the sights the village of Potteria has to offer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom cat-made ceramics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to become the pottery masters of Potteria!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Requirements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 controllers are required to play the game!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get together with your friend, slap yourselves down onto a couch, and prepare for a<strong> Cattacular</strong>\u00a0time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clay Beats</strong>\u00a0is a rhythm-based co-op game where you and your bestie get together to craft pottery for desperate customers in need! In the village of Potteria you two play as orange and black fuzzballs, cats training to be<strong> pawtastic</strong>\u00a0pottery partners! Play through several unique songs, meet whacky characters, and work together to become<strong>\u00a0pawttery</strong>\u00a0masters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourselves in a casual couch co-op experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter unique and comedic characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through seven engaging levels and custom-made songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the sights the village of Potteria has to offer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom cat-made ceramics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to become the pottery masters of Potteria!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Requirements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 controllers are required to play the game!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Clay Beats is a casual couch co-op rhythm game where two players take on two kindred cats who aim to become masters in their craft... pottery! Embark on an adventure, meet new clients, and become the pawttery masters of Potteria!",
